Keep a shared source as empty text.
Place "abbxxxxzzy" into source.
Keep a shared last as 0.
Set last to the last position of source.
Keep a shared answers as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared closing as 0.

To store from openat (a whole number) with closeat (a whole number).
The line is empty text.
Place "[" into line.
The firsttext is format whole number openat as text.
Place firsttext into line.
Place "," into line.
The secondtext is format whole number closeat as text.
Place secondtext into line.
Place "]" into line.
The copy is a copy of line.
Place copy into answers.

To check from spot (a whole number).
The next is spot plus 1.
If next is more than last, set closing to 1, return.
The current is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
The following is the slice of source from next to next plus 1.
If current does not match following, set closing to 1.

The start is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Set closing to 0.
Check from spot.
The span is spot minus start plus 1.
If closing is 1 and span is at least 3, Store from start with spot.
If closing is 1, set start to spot plus 1.

For each answer in answers, show answer.
